@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Microwave Oven

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / Display current time
Idle : do / Wait for user input

Idle --> WaitingForInput : [User presses a button]

state "Waiting for input" as WaitingForInput
WaitingForInput : entry / Get power level choice (full or half)
WaitingForInput : do / Validate power level choice
WaitingForInput : exit / Power level set, proceed to cooking time entry

WaitingForInput --> CookingTimeEntry : [Power level chosen]

state "Cooking time entry" as CookingTimeEntry
CookingTimeEntry : entry / Get cooking time from user
CookingTimeEntry : do / Validate cooking time
CookingTimeEntry : exit / Cooking time set, proceed to cooking process

CookingTimeEntry --> CookingProcess : [Cooking time entered]

state "Cooking process" as CookingProcess
CookingProcess : entry / Start cooking with chosen power level and time
CookingProcess : do / Monitor door status during cooking
CookingProcess : exit / Door opened, stop cooking or cancel

CookingProcess --> StoppedOrCancelled : [Door opened during cooking]

state "Stopped or cancelled" as StoppedOrCancelled
StoppedOrCancelled : entry / Stop cooking immediately
StoppedOrCancelled : do / Return to idle state after stopping or cancelling

StoppedOrCancelled --> Idle : [Return to idle state]

Idle --> [*]
@enduml
